<p>Depending on the skill sets and academic levels, all hourly students will be paid at $14-15 (undergrad) $16-18 (master) hourly rate based on the committed time. I can help with your reference letter for your future education applications. A good academic standing (GPA 3.4+) is required. Getting an A in related courses with interests in our research fields are strongly prefered. If there are mutual matching interests in the research projects, RA position is also an option.</p>

